    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demon Lord's Lover is a roguelike rpg and adult dating sim. Explore an ever-changing dungeon, battle enemies in turn-based, grid-based tactical combat, and develop relationships with various heroines.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore The Demon Lord's Dungeon, an ever-changing dungeon with monsters, other adventurers (friends and foes), traps, and treasures. Battle enemies turn-based, grid-based tactical combat. Use items, skills, and even the terrain to get an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Foothold, a town with a colorful cast of adventurers, artists, and outlaws. Upgrade items and skills at the shops and the training ground. Get to know the residents via quests and conversations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop relationships with various heroines, including Viola the knight, Miran the mage, Paila the seamstress, Torne the shopkeep, Nanako the isekai-ed idol, Bell the fighter, and Seri the demon lord (and your childhood friend).</p></li></ul>",
